1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:06,040
Far from Earth, the crew is the clinic. AstroKinetics reads every movement from a camera, in 3D.

2
00:00:06,190 --> 00:00:10,680
A watch and a phone learn one astronaut's normal, then move it into orbit.

3
00:00:10,830 --> 00:00:16,330
Every signal lands on one living body map. Take gravity away, and fluid shifts toward the head.

4
00:00:17,480 --> 00:00:19,130
Red flags are checked first.

5
00:00:20,580 --> 00:00:22,800
And every answer shows its evidence.

6
00:00:24,050 --> 00:00:27,980
AstroKinetics and ASTRA. Crew health that works without Earth.
